    "text": "Not weather. EI-NSB was AOG from 23 Jan 21:40Z with an engine-driven pump leak beyond AMM limits (ATA 2913) and no MEL relief, logged before Dublin's storm window of 02:30–15:00Z; the window closed 90 min before the 16:30Z STD, and 11 DUB departures operated 15:30–17:30Z. OCC's weather code 71 is struck and the cause recoded 71 → 41: a technical fault is not an extraordinary circumstance (EU261 Art.5(3); CJEU C-549/07, C-257/14), so compensation is owed and 172 payouts are drafted, pending Claims Lead approval. Cause-finding confidence 91%."
   }
